    "a-clear-bug-goes-to-builder-and-the-reporter-is-told": {
      "description": "A clear, low-risk, high-confidence report is grouped, handed to Builder on a branch named after the report that leads its group, and its thread is told once Builder accepted.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "kind": "serve",
          "operation": "slack.readThread",
          "recording": "reportOnly"
        },
        {
